# What must not reach the build context.
#
# node_modules and dist because they are this machine's -- macOS binaries for
# argon2 and dbmate, a front end built with the developer's VITE_API_URL -- and
# the image makes its own. The .env files because they hold secrets, and an
# image is a thing that gets pushed to a registry.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
